# Contrast usage example (design inspired by QQP/PAWS contrast ideas; authored
# for this repository, no external rows copied).
#
# Messages: "Is Ana a parent of Bogdan?" and "Is Bogdan a parent of Ana?" The
# two programs differ by one structural change, the roles of the same
# relation, so they must not answer the same way.
@question query
  where match
    relation "parent of"
    role subject "Ana"
    role object "Bogdan"
    polarity affirmed
  end

# --- contrast ---
@question query
  where match
    relation "parent of"
    role subject "Bogdan"
    role object "Ana"
    polarity affirmed
  end
